    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia yalakulila abaYahudi abali eMisiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa elieetsela Yeremia khukabaYahudi bosi abamenya mushialo shiaMisiri, abamenya eMigidoli, neTapanahesi, neNofu, nende mushialo shiaPatsarosi, ndielino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI omwene mahe, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, aboola; mbu Mwaluutsi obubii bwosi obwa ndaleera khuYerusalemu, nokhumataala kosi kaYuda; ne lole, leelo kali butswa amakunda; abulaho oumenyamwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khulwa obubii bwabwe obwa bakhola nibasinyisia olwa batsia okhusamba amalesi kelibuuliesi nokhukhalabanila abanyasaye bandi aba baramanya ta, kata bo, kata inywe, kata abakuuka beenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa ndamurumila abasumba baulje bosi abanabii, nimbaruma knale nilumilila okhubaruma, okhusunga mbu Bayaye, murakholanga eshisinyo shino eshia engiyanga ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa shibahulila, kata okhureka amarwi mbu bashiukhane okhurula khububii bwabwe, oburasambila abanyasaye bandi amalesi kelibuuliesi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne niko akachila nisundula obululu bwanje noburima bwanje, nibwakha mumataala kaYuda nomutsinjila tsieYerusalemu; nako nikakwa amakhaya, amakunda butswa, shinga olwa kali leelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, bulaano kano niko aka OMWAMI, Nyasaye omwene mahe, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, aboola; mbu Nishiina eshichila nimwikholela abeene obubii buno obukhongo, okhukhalaka khwinywe abasaatsa nabakhasi, abaana nende abashinuuna, hakari waYuda, nimuratong'a nomundu yesi ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbushiina nimusinyisia nebikhole biamakhono keenywe, nimusambila abanyasaye bandi amalesi kelibuuliesi mushialo shiaMisiri ewa mwatsiile okhumenya; mbu mukhalakwe, nimukwa eshilaka munwa nelinyeko mumahanga kosi keshialo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho mwakhaba nimweebilila obubii bwosi bwabakuuka beenywe, nobubii bwabaruchi baYuda, nobubii bwabakhasi babwe, nobubii bweenywe abeene, nobubii bwabakhasi beenywe, obwa mwakhola mushialo shiaYuda nomunjila tsieYerusalemu, noho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata okhuula olwa leelo bashili okhwituutuyia, kata okhuria, kata okhuchenda mumeebaalo kanje, kata mumalako kanje aka ndara imbeli weenywe, neimbeli wabakuuka beenywe ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako kano niko aka OMWAMI omwene mahe, Nyasaye waIsiraeli, aboola; mbu Lole, ndalarakhwo omwoyo okhumufukula nokhumukhupia khushibii, okhusishia Yuda yosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndalabukula omusikalo kwaYuda, abo abachoomiye tsimoni tsiabwe okhutsia mushialo shiaMisiri okhumenyayo, ne balamalilanwa; mushialo shiaMisiri nimwo omwa balakwa; balamalilanwa nolukanga khandi neinzala; balafwa pe, okhurula khumutuutu okhuula khumukhongo, khulwa olukanga nokhulwa inzala; ne balaba eshilaka munwa, abokhung'ang'aalilwa, nokhunyekwa, nokhuseywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba ndalakuuma abo abamenya mushialo shiaMisiri, shinga olwa ndakmlma Yerusalemu, nolukanga, neinzala, nende oluumbe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu mana omundu yesi owomusikalo kwaYuda, abo abatsia mushialo shiaMisiri okhumenyayo, aleshe okhwihonokokha kata okhutong'a mbu yakhakalukha mushialo shiaYuda, ewa baliibungwa amahoofu okhukalukha okhumenyayo; okhuba omundu yesi shialakalukhayo ta, habula abatuutu butswa abakhaba abeelushi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abasaatsa bosi abamanya mbu abakhasi babwe basambilanga abanyasaye bandi amalesi kelibuuliesi, halala nabakhasi bosi abali nibasinjiileho, omukanda omukhongo, mbu abandu bosi abali nibamenyanga mushialo shiaMisiri ePatsarosi, nibakahlsia Yeremia, bari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwikhuwa lino elia okhubooleele muliira liOMWAMI, shikhulakhuhulilakhwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne okhukhola khulakhola buli likhuwa elirula muminwa chieefwe, mbu okhusambila omuruchi weshikhasi owelikulu amalesi kelibuuliesi, nokhumutsushiilila emisango echiokhutsushila, shinga olwa khwakholanga, ifwe nabakuuka beefwe, abaruchi beefwe nabakhulundu beefwe, mumataala kaYuda nonutsinjila tsieYerusalemu; okhuba mundaalo etsio khwali neinzikura, nikhuli bulayi, nikhuralola libii liosi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa okhurula olwa khwalekha okhusambila omuruchi weshikhasi owelikulu amalesi kelibuuliesi nokhumutsushiilila emisango echiokhutsushila, khutambanga ebindu biosi, nikhumalilanwa nolukanga nende inzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakhasi nibameeta nibasunga mbu Olwa khwamusambilanga omuruchi weshikhasi owelikulu amalesi kelibuuliesi, nikhumutsushiililanga emisango echiokhutsushila; kho khwamuteeshelanga emikaate echilikhwo eshifwananishie nikhumutsushiilila emisango echiokhutsushila aharali abasaatsa beefwe ta, nohomba?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yeremia nasunjila abandu bosi, abasaatsa nabakhasi, abandu abo bosi abali nibamukalusiye likalusio elo, ari ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amalesi kelibuuliesi ako, aka mwasambila mumataala kaYuda nomuisinjila tsieYerusalemu, inywe nabakuuka beenywe, abaruchi beenywe nabakhulundu beenywe nabandu beshialo shino, OMWAMI shiyakeetsulila? Shikayeenjila mumapaaroke? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI yakhaywa okhutsiililila nashiisimilisilia obubii bwebikhole bieenywe nebisinyo ebia mukholanga; ne niko akachila eshialo shieenywe nishikwile likunda, eshiokhung'ang'aalilwa, eshilaka munwa, aharali oumenyamwo, shinga olwa shili leelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila mwasamba amalesi kelibuuliesi khandi shichila mwamwonoonela OMWAMI, nimurahulila amakhuwa kOMWAMI, kata okhuchenda mumeebaaloke kata mumalakoke kata muburumbusibwe ta; nishio eshichila amabii kano nikamukwiliile, shinga olwa kali leelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
