          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, ndalabahenganga okhubakhupla khushibii, ne okhuleera obulayi ta; nabo abandu bosi baYuda abali mushialo shiaMisiri balama, ilanwa nolukanga nende inzala, okhuula oiwa balaba nibahweele pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
