          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abo abalaba nibeehonokooshe khulukanga balarula mushialo shiaMisiri nibakalukha mushialo shiaYuda, abarali abanii ta; nabo bosi abomusikalo kwaYuda abatsia mushialo shiaMisiri okhumenyayo, balamanya mbu niwina owa likhuwalie lilasinjila, mbu elianje nohomba eliabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.28",
