              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI asunga mbu Lino lilamubeela eshilolelo mbu ndalamukuuma habundu hano, mumanye tieeli shinga amakhuwa kanje olwa kalasiniila okhumufukula nokhumukhupia khushibii; ",
